# --- VS / IDE ---
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# --- Git ---
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# --- Build artifacts ---
**/bin
**/obj
**/out
**/publish
**/TestResults
**/node_modules

# --- Logs / runtime data ---
**/logs
**/*.log
**/data
**/data-protection-keys

# --- Docker meta (recursive olarak hicbir Dockerfile/compose context'e dahil edilmez) ---
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*
**/.dockerignore

# --- Markdown / docs ---
**/*.md
**/docs

# --- Sertifikalar / secrets ---
**/nginx/certs/*
!**/nginx/certs/.gitkeep
**/appsettings.Production.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.env
**/.env.*
